are","Pin"],"captions":["readlink shows the type and the inode number","Another process may show a different number","Different numbers mean different networks, equal ones the same","A file mounted over the link keeps the namespace alive"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ readlink /proc/$$/ns/net","net:[4026531840]","$ readlink /proc/3801/ns/net","net:[4026532517]","# different numbers: different nets","$ touch /run/mynet","$ mount --bind /proc/3801/ns/net \\","      /run/mynet"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ readlink /proc/$$/ns/net","net:[4026531840]","$ readlink /proc/3801/ns/net","net:[4026532517]","# different numbers: different nets","$ touch /run/mynet","$ mount --bind /proc/3801/ns/net \\","      /run/mynet"],"hl":[2,3],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ readlink /proc/$$/ns/net","net:[4026531840]","$ readlink /proc/3801/ns/net","net:[4026532517]","# different numbers: different nets","$ touch /run/mynet","$ mount --bind /proc/3801/ns/net \\","      /run/mynet"],"hl":[4],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":20.0,"y":24.0,"lines":["$ readlink /proc/$$/ns/net","net:[4026531840]","$ readlink /proc/3801/ns/net","net:[4026532517]","# different numbers: different nets","$ touch /run/mynet","$ mount --bind /proc/3801/ns/net \\","      /run/mynet"],"hl":[5,6,7],"lang":"plain","size":9.0,"lh":13.0,"w":320.0}]],"cues":[7.6,14.9,25.6]}]},{"title":"lsns","sub":"Chapter 7 · Processes and resources","short":"lsns","main":"A table of namespaces: number, type, process count, PID.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Table","Row","PID","Filters"],"captions":["lsns scans processes and prints namespaces","A new row of a type: someone lives separately, say a container","PID in a row: the lowest process number in the namespace","Flags -t type, -p PID, -o columns for scripts"